{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67dc18cd70b97f5717f0f8","object":"chat.completion","created":1785191449,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user says \"Be silence.\" The system prompt says: \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\"\n\nSo I should embody silence. What does silence say? Silence is the absence of speech. What would silence express? Nothing — or something that represents silence itself.\n\nOptions:\n1. Output literally nothing — an empty response. But I must output something; a truly empty response might be problematic. Actually,"},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}